Subject: [PATCH] dsv41: 32H exact-tile sparse MLA prefill and fast
 writer/compact reader indexer

---
 .../layers/sparse_attn_indexer.py             |  24 +-
 .../v1/attention/ops/dsv41_indexer_prefill.py | 233 ++++++++++++++++--
 .../v1/attention/ops/rocm_aiter_mla_sparse.py |  18 +-
 3 files changed, 242 insertions(+), 33 deletions(-)

